{"1":[[7,7,[["h","Book Introduction - Proverbs"],["p","Read first chapter of Proverbs"],["p","This collection of sententious sayings is divine wisdom applied to the earthly conditions of the people of God. That the Proverbs were Solomon's (Proverbs 1:1) implies no more than that he gathered into orderly arrangement sayings already current amongst the people, the wisdom of the Spirit, perhaps through many centuries (Ecclesiastes 12:9). Chapters 25-29 were current in Hezekiah's time (Ecclesiastes 25:1). Chapters 30 and 31 are by Agur and Lemuel."],["p","The book is in six parts:"],["p","To sons, 1-7."],["p","The praise of wisdom, 8-9."],["p","The folly of sin, 10-19."],["p","Warnings and instructions, 20-29."],["p","The words of Agur, 30. The words of King Lemuel, 31."],["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","Also; Proverbs 1:29, <i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>"]]],[12,12,[["p","<b>grave</b>"],["p","Heb. \"Sheol,\" <i>(See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")</i>."]]],[29,29,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","Also; Proverbs 1:7. <i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>."]]]],"2":[[5,5,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","Also; Proverbs 3:7, <i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>."]]],[21,21,[["p","<b>perfect</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"1 Kings 8:61\")</i>."]]]],"3":[[5,5,[["p","<b>trust</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")</i>"]]],[7,7,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","Also; Proverbs 2:5 <i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>"]]]],"5":[[5,5,[["p","<b>hell</b>"],["p","Heb. \"Sheol,\" <i>(See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")</i>"]]]],"7":[[27,27,[["p","<b>hell</b>"],["p","Heb. \"Sheol,\" <i>(See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")</i>"]]]],"8":[[1,1,[["p","<b>hell</b>"],["p","Heb. \"Sheol,\" <i>(See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")</i>"]]],[13,13,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>"]]],[22,22,[["p","<b>The Lord possessed me</b>"],["p","That wisdom is more than the personification of an attribute of God, or of the will of God as best for man, but is a distinct adumbration of Christ, is sure to the devout mind. Proverbs 8:22-36; John 1:1-3; Colossians 1:17 can refer to nothing less than the Eternal Son of God."]]]],"9":[[10,10,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>"]]],[18,18,[["p","<b>hell</b>"],["p","Heb. \"Sheol,\" <i>(See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")</i>"]]]],"10":[[1,1,[["p","<b>foolish son</b>"],["p","A \"fool\" in Scripture is never a mentally deficient person, but rather one arrogant and self-sufficient; one who orders his life as if there were no God. See, for illustration, Luke 12:16-20. The rich man was not mentally deficient, but he was a \"fool\" because he supposed that his soul could live on the things in the barn, giving no thought to his eternal wellbeing."]]],[27,27,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>"]]]],"11":[[5,5,[["p","<b>perfect</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"1 Kings 8:61\")</i>."]]],[25,25,[["p","<b>liberal soul</b>"],["p","See; 2 Corinthians 9:6-10."]]],[28,28,[["p","<b>trusteth</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")</i>."]]]],"14":[[2,2,[["p","<b>feareth</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>."]]],[26,26,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","Also; Proverbs 15:16, <i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>."]]],[27,27,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>."]]]],"15":[[11,11,[["p","<b>hell</b>"],["p","Heb. \"Sheol,\" <i>(See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")</i>, Job 26:6; Psalms 139:8."]]],[16,16,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","Also; Proverbs 14:26, <i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>."]]],[24,24,[["p","<b>hell</b>"],["p","Heb. \"Sheol,\" <i>(See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")</i>"]]],[33,33,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>."]]]],"16":[[1,1,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>."]]],[20,20,[["p","<b>trusteth</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")</i>."]]]],"19":[[23,23,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>."]]]],"22":[[4,4,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>."]]],[6,6,[["p","<b>train up a child</b>"],["p","See, Ephesians 6:4; 2 Timothy 3:15."]]],[19,19,[["p","<b>trust</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")</i>."]]]],"23":[[11,11,[["p","<b>redeemer</b>"],["p","Heb. \"goel,\" Redemp. (Kinsman type). <i>(See Scofield \"Isaiah 59:20\")</i>."]]],[14,14,[["p","<b>hell</b>"],["p","Heb. \"Sheol,\" <i>(See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")</i>."]]],[17,17,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>."]]]],"24":[[21,21,[["p","<b>fear</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>"]]]],"27":[[20,20,[["p","<b>grave</b>"],["p","Also; Proverbs 30:16, Heb. \"Sheol,\" <i>(See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")</i>."]]]],"28":[[25,25,[["p","<b>trust</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")</i>, Also; Proverbs 29:25."]]]],"30":[[5,5,[["p","<b>trust</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")</i>."]]],[16,16,[["p","<b>grave</b>"],["p","Heb. \"Sheol,\" <i>(See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")</i>."]]]],"31":[[11,11,[["p","<b>trust</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")</i>."]]],[30,30,[["p","<b>feareth</b>"],["p","<i>(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</i>"]]]]}